WEBVTT

00:00.100 --> 00:03.140
<b>Almen</b>

00:03.140 --> 00:06.110
<b>Almen Cathedral</b>

00:08.160 --> 00:10.580
That Prismer looks really tough!

00:11.080 --> 00:15.760
They were able to defeat it, 
but they couldn't move it,

00:15.760 --> 00:19.290
so they ended up building this 
cathedral to keep watch over it.

00:19.650 --> 00:23.890
You think if we melted the ice 
like we did with Lyn, it'd start moving?

00:23.890 --> 00:25.620
Quiet, Chris!

00:25.620 --> 00:28.260
If you say weird stuff here, 
they'll arrest you!

00:28.260 --> 00:29.960
But... But...

00:29.960 --> 00:35.470
It's frozen, but I can still feel some kind 
of power pulsing within it!

00:35.470 --> 00:37.450
It might not be dead!

00:37.450 --> 00:39.290
I just said...

00:39.290 --> 00:40.420
You there!

00:42.820 --> 00:44.450
It's nothing!

00:44.450 --> 00:47.140
She's just a little weird...

00:47.830 --> 00:50.350
They say magicite beasts 
have appeared in town.

00:50.350 --> 00:52.350
It's dangerous, so stay here!

00:52.350 --> 00:53.860
Magicite beasts?

00:53.860 --> 00:55.930
I can't wait!

00:55.930 --> 00:57.950
Rani, catch up when you can!

00:57.950 --> 01:00.910
Aww, Chris, c'mon!

01:00.910 --> 01:03.430
She's usually not this worked up...

01:04.420 --> 01:05.870
Hurry! Over here!

01:05.060 --> 01:05.880
This way!

01:06.300 --> 01:09.840
<i>You can tell they built this town 
to keep watch over the Prismer.</i>

01:09.840 --> 01:11.790
<i>It certainly has no shortage of knights!</i>

01:21.070 --> 01:22.580
Wow!

01:44.080 --> 01:47.040
<b><u>Reborn</u></b>

01:44.080 --> 01:47.040
<b>to Master the Blade
\h\h\h\h\hFrom Hero-King to Extraordinary Squire\h\h\h\h\h</b>

01:44.080 --> 01:47.040
<b>to Master the Blade
From Hero-King to Extraordinary Squire</b>

03:00.030 --> 03:05.030
<b>Episode 5    Royal Knights' Academy</b>

03:00.380 --> 03:01.600
You fool!

03:01.600 --> 03:06.070
It's suicide to try and fight a magicite 
beast with no Rune or Artifact!

03:06.070 --> 03:09.320
<i>I can tell from how she moves that she's 
spent no small amount of time training.</i>

03:07.240 --> 03:09.320
Don't throw your life away!

03:09.740 --> 03:11.570
<i>A Greater Rune?</i>

03:11.570 --> 03:13.280
<i>The same as Rani?</i>

03:13.280 --> 03:16.620
Th-Thanks! I'll be okay, though!

03:16.070 --> 03:17.070
They're coming!

03:17.070 --> 03:18.000
Fall back!

03:19.250 --> 03:21.710
I'll cut them all down at once!

03:22.010 --> 03:24.420
<i>Oh? Very good!</i>

03:24.760 --> 03:28.630
Are you hurt? You need to find shelter!

03:29.640 --> 03:30.430
Behind you!

03:31.350 --> 03:32.440
It's no good!

03:35.560 --> 03:36.480
Now, take this!

03:38.490 --> 03:39.780
Stupid little thing...

03:39.780 --> 03:41.230
I'll help you!

03:42.620 --> 03:43.250
She's fast!

03:45.590 --> 03:47.330
Now! Hit it!

03:47.330 --> 03:49.110
O-Okay!

03:51.750 --> 03:53.450
I'll keep going!

04:01.030 --> 04:02.210
Nice!

04:02.460 --> 04:03.850
You too...

04:03.850 --> 04:06.220
I guess you didn't need my help before.

04:06.220 --> 04:07.740
Sorry.

04:07.740 --> 04:09.420
What's your name?

04:09.950 --> 04:12.390
Inglis Eucus.

04:12.660 --> 04:15.850
I'm Leone. Leone Olfa.

04:16.190 --> 04:18.830
<i>Olfa? I've heard that name before...</i>

04:19.160 --> 04:20.980
Let's work together.

04:20.980 --> 04:22.890
Right, Leone.

04:23.580 --> 04:25.080
Let's get to it!

04:25.980 --> 04:30.180
One, two, three!

04:36.280 --> 04:37.970
Nice, a clean hit!

04:37.970 --> 04:38.960
Rani!

04:38.960 --> 04:43.010
Chris! You ran off and left me!

04:45.120 --> 04:47.460
I guess that was the last of them.

04:47.890 --> 04:49.430
This is Leone.

04:49.430 --> 04:51.430
We ran into each other and teamed up.

04:51.430 --> 04:53.900
Thanks. You were a big help.

04:54.160 --> 04:57.680
Thank you! I'm Rafinha Bilford.

04:57.680 --> 04:58.850
Nice to meet you!

04:59.360 --> 05:00.890
"Bilford"?

05:00.890 --> 05:04.350
Then, you're Master Rafael's younger sister?

05:05.090 --> 05:07.320
You know Brother Raf?

05:08.440 --> 05:10.180
Y-Yes.

05:10.790 --> 05:13.550
He's been very good to me.

05:14.970 --> 05:16.490
You three.

05:17.170 --> 05:20.120
Thanks for helping protect the town.

05:20.120 --> 05:23.250
We'd like to offer you a small reward...

05:24.050 --> 05:26.480
Isn't that great, Chris and Leone?

05:26.740 --> 05:28.750
Just you two.

05:30.120 --> 05:33.430
We've got nothing to give a clan of traitors.

05:33.430 --> 05:35.280
Traitors?

05:35.280 --> 05:39.400
Wait! Leone helped too!

05:39.400 --> 05:40.950
It's okay, Rafinha.

05:40.950 --> 05:42.350
Go without me.

05:42.350 --> 05:44.660
No! It doesn't make sense!

05:44.660 --> 05:47.780
You don't seem to know, so I'll fill you in.

05:47.780 --> 05:50.140
That woman is the sister of Leon Olfa,

05:50.140 --> 05:57.280
a former holy knight who 
betrayed this country and fled.

05:57.620 --> 06:00.680
Leon Olfa...?

06:03.950 --> 06:06.350
That explains where 
I'd heard the name before.

06:06.770 --> 06:10.290
If you're seen together, 
people will start to talk.

06:10.760 --> 06:12.880
Now, we can give you that 
reward over there...

06:12.880 --> 06:14.000
No, thank you!

06:14.000 --> 06:16.000
I don't need any reward 
from the likes of you!

06:32.750 --> 06:34.140
What's going on here?

06:34.140 --> 06:35.590
Master Rafael!

06:36.160 --> 06:39.370
It's just the traitorous knight's sister.

06:39.370 --> 06:41.750
You don't need to worry about her...

06:41.830 --> 06:45.880
<b>Rafael  Age 23</b>

06:42.330 --> 06:45.950
Please don't talk about Leone like that.

06:46.350 --> 06:50.810
She helped with the magicite 
beasts again, didn't she?

06:50.810 --> 06:52.300
You could give her a little cred—

06:52.300 --> 06:53.820
Brother Raf!

06:53.820 --> 06:54.720
Rani?

06:54.720 --> 06:56.140
Is that you, Rani?

06:56.140 --> 06:58.260
I never thought I'd see you here.

06:58.510 --> 07:01.360
It's been a long time, cousin.

07:05.650 --> 07:07.950
<i>He's grown into a fine young man.</i>

07:08.280 --> 07:10.530
Y-You've become such a pretty lady.

07:10.920 --> 07:12.760
I didn't recognize you.

07:12.760 --> 07:17.730
Oh, Rafael almost never has 
anything nice to say about girls.

07:18.190 --> 07:20.870
Girls love him, but he's incredibly dense.

07:20.870 --> 07:23.750
S-Stop it, Ripple...

07:26.140 --> 07:27.800
This is Ripple.

07:28.450 --> 07:32.050
One of our nation's Hyral Menases, 
alongside Eris.

07:32.050 --> 07:33.850
Nice to meet you!

07:34.660 --> 07:36.370
<i>A Hyral Menas?</i>

07:36.370 --> 07:38.030
<i>I bet she's strong!</i>

07:38.590 --> 07:42.050
What are you two doing here?

07:42.050 --> 07:44.770
Also, you know Leone?

07:45.030 --> 07:46.170
Well...

07:46.910 --> 07:48.700
Are you hungry?

07:48.700 --> 07:50.810
We can talk about it over a meal!

07:50.810 --> 07:52.700
I'm always up for food!

07:53.260 --> 07:55.080
Come with us too, Leone.

07:55.080 --> 07:57.530
I need to thank you for helping the girls.

07:59.550 --> 08:02.050
So all that happened in Nova?

08:02.720 --> 08:06.290
I'd heard their magistrate went missing.

08:06.290 --> 08:10.770
But I can't believe you two survived a 
meeting with the Bloodchain Brigade's leader.

08:10.770 --> 08:14.530
What I'm most curious about 
is the Levitation Circle.

08:14.530 --> 08:18.720
You knew about it, and you still handed 
the city over to the Highland?

08:18.720 --> 08:23.420
If you did, I think that's 
a problem, Brother.

08:23.690 --> 08:27.020
Yeah, you're right.

08:27.020 --> 08:31.310
So it's not just Rafael. You two agree, huh?

08:32.900 --> 08:36.600
And that's the magistrate, 
who's now a magicite beast?

08:36.600 --> 08:38.420
She's cute.

08:38.420 --> 08:40.630
It's hard to believe she's a magicite beast!

08:41.650 --> 08:44.340
She shouldn't be in there!

08:44.340 --> 08:46.830
Please, do something!

08:46.830 --> 08:48.570
S-Sorry.

08:48.570 --> 08:51.220
She likes girls with big breasts.

08:51.220 --> 08:54.290
Hooray! It's not just me anymore!

08:58.730 --> 09:01.960
What was with that knight, though?

09:01.960 --> 09:03.770
He didn't need to be such a jerk.

09:03.770 --> 09:05.480
It happens all the time.

09:05.480 --> 09:08.740
But you still fight to 
protect the townspeople?

09:09.030 --> 09:13.220
You can't worry about that stuff 
when the magicite beasts are attacking.

09:13.220 --> 09:15.840
Yeah, you're right!

09:15.840 --> 09:17.070
I respect that!

09:17.410 --> 09:18.870
Thank you.

09:18.870 --> 09:22.860
But don't be too hard on the townspeople.

09:22.860 --> 09:25.270
They just expect a lot out 
of holy knights, that's all.

09:26.070 --> 09:31.790
Everyone was so proud of my brother because 
he was the first holy knight from our town.

09:32.230 --> 09:35.670
And then he killed not only 
a Highlander emissary,

09:35.670 --> 09:39.080
but even the inspector from the capital.

09:39.640 --> 09:43.070
Wait. Lord Shiony, the inspector, was...

09:43.070 --> 09:47.250
So they told the public 
that it was all Leon's doing.

09:47.250 --> 09:51.350
But doesn't that make him out 
to be a really bad guy?

09:51.350 --> 09:54.990
He was only mad because of what Rahl did!

09:55.480 --> 09:58.580
You met my brother?

09:58.580 --> 10:00.130
Y-Yeah.

10:00.130 --> 10:02.490
He was easy to talk to and a lot of fun.

10:02.490 --> 10:04.450
He wasn't a bad person.

10:04.450 --> 10:07.150
Yeah, I agree completely.

10:07.450 --> 10:09.960
Thank you for saying that.

10:10.990 --> 10:12.990
But it's okay...

10:13.330 --> 10:20.500
Prince Wein and Rafael explained everything, 
and they even apologized.

10:21.260 --> 10:25.600
I know an apology doesn't come 
close to making things right...

10:25.850 --> 10:27.620
No matter how it happened,

10:27.620 --> 10:31.960
it's still true that my brother cast aside 
the title of holy knight and this nation.

10:32.350 --> 10:33.830
Leone...

10:34.560 --> 10:40.640
So I'm going to become a full-fledged knight 
and capture him.

10:41.020 --> 10:45.690
If you need to become a full-fledged knight, 
does that mean...

10:45.690 --> 10:48.740
She's going to the knights' academy 
in the capital city.

10:48.740 --> 10:50.000
Really?

10:50.000 --> 10:52.700
So are we!

10:52.700 --> 10:54.520
You are?

10:54.520 --> 10:56.420
That's great.

10:56.420 --> 10:58.570
If I'm with you...

10:58.570 --> 11:00.380
What a coincidence!

11:00.380 --> 11:01.770
This'll be the start of a long friendship!

11:01.770 --> 11:03.150
It sure will!

11:03.150 --> 11:04.470
Yeah!

11:05.080 --> 11:11.470
I'm hoping they can solve the problem 
of the magicite beasts appearing in town.

11:11.470 --> 11:13.550
They just appear all of a sudden in town?

11:13.550 --> 11:15.390
That's strange.

11:15.390 --> 11:17.270
The place is well-guarded.

11:17.270 --> 11:19.190
It's been happening a lot lately.

11:19.190 --> 11:22.950
They just show up in the middle of 
the city without any Prism Flow...

11:22.950 --> 11:26.000
You don't need to worry about that, Leone.

11:45.860 --> 11:51.600
We think the frozen Prismer is what's 
been drawing the magicite beasts.

11:51.600 --> 11:52.360
So...

11:52.690 --> 11:58.310
So if you carry it somewhere else, 
they'll stop appearing in town.

11:58.680 --> 12:00.780
What a sight, huh?

12:00.780 --> 12:03.410
I didn't know Flying Gears could do that!

12:04.100 --> 12:05.900
What did you want to talk about?

12:06.570 --> 12:10.490
You're the crazy-powerful girl 
Eris told me about, right?

12:10.860 --> 12:13.340
Eris told you about me?

12:13.860 --> 12:17.930
We're keeping it a secret between us 
Hyral Menases for now, though.

12:17.930 --> 12:19.570
Thank you very much.

12:19.960 --> 12:22.940
So, whaddya think? Can you beat it?

12:23.220 --> 12:25.880
Nobody fights to lose.

12:25.880 --> 12:30.720
The truth is, it was the one who 
locked itself inside that ice.

12:30.720 --> 12:33.260
This was decades ago.

12:34.010 --> 12:35.970
I saw it with my own eyes.

12:36.750 --> 12:40.780
I heard once that Hyral Menases 
have long lifespans, but...

12:40.780 --> 12:43.550
I'm actually quite the old lady.

12:43.550 --> 12:44.940
So's Eris.

12:45.340 --> 12:48.570
<i>Actually, though, I'm an old man...</i>

12:48.910 --> 12:52.600
We tell everyone it's a corpse 
so they don't get scared.

12:52.600 --> 12:57.370
What's happened lately is a sign 
that it'll soon revive.

12:57.670 --> 13:00.580
So you're carrying it near the border,

13:00.580 --> 13:03.910
and away from any cities, in case it does?

13:04.420 --> 13:07.810
And not only that, you're using 
the magicite beasts it creates

13:07.810 --> 13:10.150
as a defense against invasion 
by enemy countries...

13:10.150 --> 13:11.660
You look upset.

13:11.660 --> 13:13.220
It's a waste!

13:13.220 --> 13:16.860
The magicite beasts and invading armies 
will destroy each other!

13:18.240 --> 13:22.160
But this is a great spot to fight a Prismer 
without worrying about the surroundings.

13:22.160 --> 13:26.460
Yup! It's nice to see you're 
looking at this optimistically.

13:26.460 --> 13:27.390
Of course!

13:27.390 --> 13:29.070
Make sure you call me when it happens!

13:29.400 --> 13:31.780
Let's make a pinky promise, then.

13:41.100 --> 13:45.510
Ripple and I will stay here to supervise 
the transport, so this is goodbye.

13:45.950 --> 13:50.470
We're sending this Flying Gear Port 
back to the capital. You can ride it there.

13:59.090 --> 14:03.700
<i>Please revive soon, so we can 
fight to our hearts' content!</i>

14:08.200 --> 14:10.990
<b>Capital City Kyral</b>

14:11.720 --> 14:14.910
<i>And on the day we started at the school...</i>

14:24.520 --> 14:29.510
We welcome you to the 
Royal Knights' Academy.

14:29.640 --> 14:33.600
<b>Prince Wein</b>

14:30.140 --> 14:33.720
Everyone here has been chosen 
to become a knight

14:33.810 --> 14:37.140
<b>Principal Miliera</b>

14:34.130 --> 14:38.930
in order to protect our nation 
of Caralia and its citizens.

14:39.650 --> 14:42.110
Study hard, and keep 
your honor and the weight

14:42.110 --> 14:44.420
of the responsibility you bear 
in your hearts at all times.

14:48.760 --> 14:53.990
Hello, everyone! 
I'm Miliera, your principal!

14:53.990 --> 14:56.200
Nice to meet you all!

14:55.090 --> 14:58.560
That's the principal?

14:58.560 --> 15:00.090
Look carefully.

15:01.700 --> 15:03.230
A Special-class Rune!

15:03.230 --> 15:06.050
Just like Brother Raf. Which means...

15:06.350 --> 15:08.960
She's strong enough to be a holy knight.

15:08.960 --> 15:13.260
Did you hear the rumor about 
one of the new students?

15:13.260 --> 15:15.820
The little sister of a Highlander-killer?

15:15.820 --> 15:17.360
Is that true?

15:18.940 --> 15:21.930
The principal's talking, okay?

15:21.930 --> 15:26.610
But nobody's got time for long speeches, 
so let's begin the orientation!

15:26.610 --> 15:29.140
Let's start with warm-ups!

15:31.650 --> 15:32.370
What?

15:32.370 --> 15:33.130
An earthquake?!

15:37.070 --> 15:41.240
Everyone in the knights' class, 
I trust you've left your Artifacts behind?

15:41.240 --> 15:42.150
Yes!

15:41.650 --> 15:43.040
I have!

15:43.380 --> 15:44.640
Then...

15:55.810 --> 15:58.140
What is this?

15:58.500 --> 16:00.860
My body's so heavy...

16:00.860 --> 16:04.530
This is a powerful gravity field 
generated by my Artifact.

16:04.530 --> 16:08.310
You'll do your combat training inside it!

16:08.310 --> 16:12.280
It makes me sad when my students 
die on the battlefield,

16:12.820 --> 16:17.780
so I'm going to train you as 
hard as I possibly can, okay?

16:18.190 --> 16:20.850
This is great! I love this school!

16:20.850 --> 16:24.280
This is rough without an Artifact.

16:24.750 --> 16:27.250
It's good training, though!

16:27.250 --> 16:30.050
Okay, here we go!

16:33.560 --> 16:36.130
Time to play a game of tag! They're "it"!

16:36.410 --> 16:40.570
If you can avoid being 
tagged for ten minutes,

16:40.570 --> 16:44.360
you get a whole month's 
free food at the cafeteria!

16:44.360 --> 16:45.830
That'd be a lifesaver!

16:45.830 --> 16:47.700
We have to win, then!

16:47.700 --> 16:50.290
But I feel so heavy!

16:50.810 --> 16:52.730
Don't worry, Rani.

16:52.730 --> 16:54.830
Then without further ado...

16:54.830 --> 16:56.770
Ready... and go!

16:57.450 --> 16:58.740
Haah!

17:01.200 --> 17:02.410
Take that!

17:02.410 --> 17:03.620
And that!

17:05.770 --> 17:07.430
Phew... There we go!

17:07.430 --> 17:08.480
Hooray!

17:08.480 --> 17:10.720
A month of all the free food we can eat!

17:10.720 --> 17:12.660
You're amazing, Inglis!

17:13.160 --> 17:14.880
Does that mean...

17:15.190 --> 17:17.510
Nobody got tagged, so...

17:17.780 --> 17:20.680
We all get free food for a month?

17:21.420 --> 17:26.010
What you just saw was a demonstration 
that knocking them...

17:26.010 --> 17:28.560
out of the ring doesn't count!

17:28.950 --> 17:32.400
Ma'am, I don't think that's fair.

17:32.400 --> 17:35.120
I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

17:35.120 --> 17:36.990
I messed up.

17:36.990 --> 17:39.380
One more time, please!

17:42.900 --> 17:46.330
That was also a demonstration, okay?

17:46.330 --> 17:50.790
You know, it's so important 
I had to show you twice!

17:53.090 --> 17:58.930
Listen. I'll give you three free months if 
you stop throwing my golems outside the ring!

17:58.930 --> 18:01.910
Give it to the three of us, and it's a deal.

18:01.910 --> 18:04.740
Very well. A bargain has been struck!

18:06.030 --> 18:08.180
Now, let's try this again.

18:08.180 --> 18:10.140
Ready, go!

18:14.360 --> 18:17.080
Ninety seconds left.

18:19.910 --> 18:25.840
<i>Four knights and one squire remain.</i>

18:27.700 --> 18:29.640
I-It's coming!

18:29.640 --> 18:30.750
Get away!

18:32.450 --> 18:34.030
Don't push me, Pram!

18:34.030 --> 18:36.040
I'm sorry, Rati!

18:38.250 --> 18:43.980
It won't be that easy to 
defeat Liselotte Arcia!

18:45.930 --> 18:47.900
Sixty seconds left!

18:47.900 --> 18:49.680
You're almost there!

18:49.680 --> 18:52.370
I'm increasing the gravitational pull!

18:54.090 --> 18:55.610
Wow!

18:56.280 --> 18:57.690
This is great!

18:58.710 --> 19:00.690
I can't take it anymore...

19:00.690 --> 19:02.900
I c-can't move!

19:04.800 --> 19:08.330
You're so heavy! I'm going to die!

19:09.280 --> 19:11.560
Don't you dare touch me!

19:15.870 --> 19:18.050
Last one standing!

19:21.760 --> 19:22.840
It's over!

19:25.350 --> 19:26.350
She's so strong!

19:26.350 --> 19:27.610
Is she a squire?

19:27.610 --> 19:29.280
She was so amazing back there!

19:29.280 --> 19:31.490
She's pretty, too.

19:32.140 --> 19:34.260
All done!

19:34.260 --> 19:38.390
Inglis gets the free meal tickets, then!

19:39.560 --> 19:41.320
How fascinating!

19:41.870 --> 19:46.030
I'd love to ask you all kinds of questions.

19:46.350 --> 19:51.750
S-Sure, as long as you keep your promise.

19:54.130 --> 19:57.210
The food in the cafeteria was so good!

19:57.210 --> 20:00.690
And we get to eat as much as we want! Wow!

20:00.690 --> 20:03.390
The desserts were great, too!

20:03.390 --> 20:08.130
Leone should've stayed for dessert 
instead of heading back alone.

20:08.400 --> 20:12.350
I told you, I can't stay in a room like this.

20:12.970 --> 20:16.320
I'm supposed to trust the sister of a 
holy knight who betrayed his country?

20:16.620 --> 20:20.270
Why was she even allowed to enroll?

20:20.270 --> 20:26.560
Well, the academy decided there 
was nothing wrong with her...

20:26.560 --> 20:28.690
And I'm saying that decision was wrong!

20:28.690 --> 20:33.410
The least you can do is reassign her 
to a different room!

20:34.590 --> 20:36.990
Very well.

20:37.430 --> 20:40.190
Would anyone like to switch rooms?

20:40.190 --> 20:43.810
Okay! Come to our room, then!

20:44.350 --> 20:45.900
You're all so mean!

20:45.900 --> 20:50.350
She fought the magicite beasts 
to protect the people of Almen!

20:50.350 --> 20:53.020
Even when they said awful things 
about her, she never complained!

20:53.020 --> 20:55.740
A girl like that can't be a bad person!

20:55.740 --> 20:57.730
Rani, calm down.

20:58.090 --> 21:00.660
We'll have three people in our room.

21:01.670 --> 21:03.690
Let's go, Leone.

21:07.330 --> 21:09.490
I'm sorry this keeps happening.

21:17.700 --> 21:20.790
I still think I should sleep on the floor.

21:20.790 --> 21:23.160
It's fine. We can sleep in the same bed.

21:23.160 --> 21:25.120
Me too, then!

21:27.130 --> 21:29.050
We can all sleep in the same bed!

21:29.050 --> 21:31.720
Thank you both!

21:38.990 --> 21:40.780
She sure fell asleep fast.

21:40.780 --> 21:42.520
It's her first day at school.

21:42.520 --> 21:43.990
She's tired.

21:43.990 --> 21:48.200
It's been so long since I slept in 
the same bed as someone else.

21:48.200 --> 21:50.400
You're not alone.

21:50.810 --> 21:52.710
We're with you.

21:52.710 --> 21:54.210
Don't worry.

21:58.440 --> 22:02.210
Thank you, Inglis...

